# Reins of the Spectral Bear: the 55-point reward of the Legacy Progress Track.
# The reins are the 55 Legacy Points reward.
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 via
# wago.tools (ItemSparse 277718: level 60, Journeyman Riding, account-wide).

step Journeyman Riding
  tip The reins need level 60 and Journeyman Riding (Forever client). Train it at your race's riding trainer; see the Level 60 mount guides.
  level 60
  skill Riding 150

step 55 Legacy Points
  tip Legacy Points are account-wide: each Legacy Challenge (a class reaching 25, 45 and 60, professions, PvP, exploring) is worth one. The Progress Track gives the Replica Ironforge Air Rifle at 15, the Spectral Bear Cub at 25, the Spectral Bear Tabard at 40 and the reins at 55. How rewards are delivered is not known yet (perhaps by mail); this goal ticks once the reins are in your bags.
  collect 277718 "Reins of the Spectral Bear"
